WEBVTT

00:07:57.681 --> 00:08:01.769
(Applause)

00:08:02.478 --> 00:08:04.730
Now, here's the great news.

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:08.817
You don't have to go
to a war zone to do this.

00:08:09.276 --> 00:08:12.738
I've applied my formula
in a bunch of other settings.

00:08:12.738 --> 00:08:16.116
So let me share a couple
of quick stories with you.

00:08:17.618 --> 00:08:22.373
Early in my career, 1971, to be exact,

00:08:22.414 --> 00:08:25.876
I was living a life of crime.

00:08:26.377 --> 00:08:28.170
Crime prevention, that is.

00:08:28.212 --> 00:08:29.213
(Laughter)

00:08:29.213 --> 00:08:32.091
I was also deeply immersed
in the women's movement.